  "decisions": [
    "A0HX modifies local P8, not the original event damage; feed the changed value to downstream implemented listeners.",
    "A0IK 125 bonus uses ATTACK_TYPE_NORMAL/DAMAGE_TYPE_NORMAL; A0HX uses ATTACK_TYPE_MELEE/DAMAGE_TYPE_MAGIC.",
    "A0IJ DataA is absent; do not invent the tooltip 100 damage. Known first-level duration and target conditions use immediate native-control adaptation.",
    "Immediate ice bonus kill adds A0IL but does not set charges. Frozen ordinary lethal damage is marked before HP subtraction and does not run the later dead-marked branch in the same event.",
    "Frost1 appears once, as a function definition only; do not invent registration or use its different StringHash(1) counter.",
    "Native attack event decrements a positive A0IK rawcode counter; only new count==1 removes A0IL. Cancellation does not refund and secondary arrows do not consume more."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Native A0IJ projectile/cast delay, DataA damage and default fields are absent.",
    "A0IL uses existing native barrage adaptation; exact target order/version stacking is still partial.",
    "Other branches between the prefix and duel (A0XM, A0I5, DemonStatueBounce, A0I1) remain separately deferred where unresolved.",
    "Native defender attack windup and exact projectile timing remain a host boundary."
  ],
  "nativeAttackTypeReference": {
